OL,3,AUK government set to publish new
OL,4,Atreaties agreed with EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government and the EU are set to
OL,7,Fpublish the texts of two treaties that
OL,8,Fwere agreed last week as part of a
OL,9,Fpost-Brexit reset.
OL,11,FThe treaties will be published on
OL,12,FThursday afternoon, alongside
OL,13,Flegislation which is designed to enact
OL,14,Fthe bulk of the deal.
OL,16,FThe BBC understands the treaties have a
OL,17,F10-year termination clause that would
OL,18,Fmean if one party ended the agreement,
OL,19,Fthey would have to pay to rebuild
OL,20,Fborder checks infrastructure, which
OL,21,Fwill be significantly scaled back as
OL,22,Fpart of the new deal.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
