OL,3,AHas global jihadism failed, or is it
OL,4,Asimply changing shape?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHas global jihadism failed, or is it
OL,7,Fsimply changing shape?
OL,9,FRice, pasta, sugar, cooking oil and
OL,10,Fbeans are hardly what you'd expect to
OL,11,Fsee in jihadist propaganda. Yet these
OL,12,Fwere among the supplies that al-Qaeda's
OL,13,FSomali branch, al-Shabab, said its
OL,14,F"charity" had handed out to hundreds of
OL,15,Fstruggling families in August, as it
OL,16,Fpublicised the aid through its social
OL,17,Fmedia accounts and radio station.
OL,19,FThe group, which controls large parts
OL,20,Fof rural southern and central Somalia,
OL,21,Fhas been keen to show off its so-called
OL,22,Fhumanitarian work throughout 2026.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
